    "Part of Universe",
    "Rebuild your footage using letters, numbers, and symbols based on source brightness values.",
    "https://youtu.be/C78KLsBmdm8",
    "https://youtu.be/YxCwBT-U7d8",
    "2043905",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Hero.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Hero.jpg",
    "productContent_video_BlockType",
    "Getting Started",
    "<p>Symbol Mapper rebuilds your footage using letters, numbers, and symbols based on source brightness values. Great for creating Matrix style effects or retro type-based graphics.</p>",
    "<a href=\"https://vimeo.com/818292044\">Watch the Tutorial</a>",
    "https://youtu.be/TlEBUnQaJ9Y",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Getting_Started.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Getting_Started.jpg",
    "modal",
    "productContent_image_BlockType",
    "Grid Settings",
    "<p>Animate the effect on and off directionally or randomly. Dial in the desired look by adjusting the symbol size and grid spacing.</p>",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Grid.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Grid.jpg",
    "Symbol Settings",
    "<p>Choose the character type that best suits your purpose and give it some life with a random evolution.</p>",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Settings.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Settings.jpg",
    "Color",
    "<p>Map, animate, and randomize the color of your symbols. Control the intensity of up to three colors to emphasize one over another and make your image pop.</p>",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Color.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Color.jpg",
    "left",
    "Screen Effects",
    "<p>Add scanlines and glow to simulate the look of text on a computer screen or display panel.</p>",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Screen_Effects.jpg",
    "Universe_Symbol_Mapper_Screen_Effects.jpg",
    "/en/product-detail/red-giant/universe/symbol-mapper-tool",
